# Gates that exist only on Death Race DR-1A. Their outputs are selected through
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
# netlist/deathrace.overrides, so they are idle on Demolition Derby.
chip 13R 7408
chip 4P 7432
# Sheet L, hand added: 4S LADO starts the scream of sheet W when a car scores a hit.
chip 4S 7400

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net TNVD14 13R.11
net 5TCBL 13R.13
net 1PNVD 13R.12
net GTHX 4P.6
net GTHD 4P.5
net HTHD 4P.4
net LADO 4S.6 BOARD
net 5LNCK 4S.4
net 5LMCK 4S.5
